::summary
Anything revealed on hover has a keyboard path.
::

::app-shell[layout=adaptive]

::: toolbar[title="App"]
- button[label="Share" action=share reveal=hover]
- button[label="Copy" action=copy reveal=hover key=mod+c]
:::

::: sidebar[position=left]
::::row[icon=doc href=#a reveal=hover focus=none]
A
::::
::::row[icon=doc href=#b reveal=hover focus=2]
